1. Zed (zed-industries/zed) -- GPL-3.0-or-later
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Pinned at commit d9e1c024f393832765a03f4de204d6c8cd9abcb2.

This project reuses Zed source code, which is why the project as a whole is
GPL-3.0-or-later. Every file below carries a header naming its upstream path and
commit; the reuse is by copy-then-rewrite or by transcription, not by linking.

  rust/acp-core/src/agent.rs          <- crates/agent_servers/src/acp.rs
  rust/acp-core/src/capabilities.rs   <- crates/agent_servers/src/acp.rs
  rust/acp-core/src/terminal_auth.rs  <- crates/agent_servers/src/acp.rs
  rust/pty/src/shell.rs               <- crates/util/src/shell_builder.rs
  rust/registry/src/archive.rs        <- crates/project/src/agent_server_store.rs
  rust/registry/src/install.rs        <- crates/project/src/agent_server_store.rs
  rust/registry/src/index.rs          <- crates/project/src/agent_registry_store.rs
  rust/registry/src/download.rs       <- crates/http_client/src/github_download.rs
  rust/registry/src/node.rs           <- crates/node_runtime/src/node_runtime.rs
  rust/acp-core/assets/zed-icon.svg   <- assets/icons/ai_zed.svg

  sidecar/zed-agent-acp/.cargo/config.toml <- .cargo/config.toml
  sidecar/zed-agent-acp/build.rs           <- crates/eval_cli/build.rs
  sidecar/zed-agent-acp/src/headless.rs    <- crates/eval_cli/src/headless.rs
  sidecar/zed-agent-acp/src/session.rs     <- crates/eval_cli/src/main.rs
  sidecar/zed-agent-acp/src/translate.rs   <- crates/agent/src/agent.rs

The sidecar (sidecar/zed-agent-acp) is a separate cargo workspace that builds
against Zed crates by path dependency. Binary distributions of it are covered by
the same GPL-3.0-or-later terms; the corresponding source is this repository
plus the pinned Zed revision above.

Note: Zed's gpui, util and collections crates are Apache-2.0 upstream; the
crates this project reuses from are GPL-3.0-or-later.

